<mxCell id="c36" value="1 Tags are enforced at creation and activated as cost allocation tags.  ·  2 Data Exports writes the hourly bill (CUR 2.0) to S3.  ·  3 Athena and QuickSight turn it into per-team showback.&lt;br&gt;4 Budgets and anomaly detection alert the owning team, not a shared inbox.  ·  5 Optimizer recommendations are ranked by dollars.  ·  6 Teams act; commitments are bought centrally." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#3C4043;fontStyle=0;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="930" width="1580" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram>
